# docs/prompts-history/ holds archived prompt-session logs written by
# scripts/prompt-history.mjs. Links inside them (repo-relative paths like
# docs/deploy-ovh.md, and stack traces with absolute Windows paths) were
# valid in the original session context at the repo root; resolved from the
# archive directory they point nowhere. Rewriting historical archives would
# falsify them, so lychee skips any URL under this directory.
docs/prompts-history/
